OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 69, dies in one-vehicle crash
OL,4,Ain Dundee
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 69-year-old man has died following a
OL,7,Fone-vehicle crash in Dundee.
OL,9,FThe accident, involving a silver
OL,10,FHyundai IX35, happened on Johnston
OL,11,FAvenue, between Strathmore Avenue and
OL,12,FClepington Road, at about 08:10 on
OL,13,FFriday.
OL,15,FThe driver was taken to hospital where
OL,16,Fhe was pronounced dead. His passenger,
OL,17,Fa 63-year-old woman, was taken to
OL,18,Fhospital to be checked over.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
